OL,3,ARise in babies in care proceedings
OL,4,Araises fears of unnecessary adoptions,
OL,5,Aexperts tell BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe number of children involved in care
OL,8,Fproceedings before they reach their
OL,9,Ffirst birthdays is at a persistently
OL,10,Fhigh level across England, according to
OL,11,Fexperts who have published new figures.
OL,13,FData from the universities of Lancaster
OL,14,Fand Oxford indicates care proceedings
OL,15,Ffor babies have risen by 64% over the
OL,16,Fpast two decades, with one in 118
OL,17,Finfants affected. The figures - up to
OL,18,F2024-25 - peaked during Covid, before
OL,19,Fdropping slightly and plateauing.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
