OL,3,AFort Hood shooter to be executed by
OL,4,Afiring squad - a first for US military
OL,5,Asince World War Two
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Pentagon has announced it will
OL,8,Fexecute a former US Army major by
OL,9,Ffiring squad, the first such military
OL,10,Fexecution in more than 60 years.
OL,12,FNidal Hasan fatally shot 13 unarmed US
OL,13,Fsoldiers at Fort Hood in 2009, injuring
OL,14,Fanother 32.
OL,16,FPentagon spokesperson Sean Parnell
OL,17,Fannounced on social media on Monday
OL,18,Fthat Secretary of War Pete Hegseth had
OL,19,Fmade the recommendation and President
OL,20,FDonald Trump approved it.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
